# Credentials for the contact form and the "send me your doodle" button.
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values.
#
# These are inlined into the built JavaScript and are publicly visible. That is
# expected: both services issue browser-side keys for exactly this. What keeps
# them from being abused is the per-service restriction, not the secrecy of the
# key — see the notes on each block below.
#
# Restart `npm start` after changing them. `.env.local` is gitignored, so the
# values are only baked in when YOU run `npm run build` / `npm run deploy`.

# --- EmailJS (https://dashboard.emailjs.com) ---------------------------------
# Service ID: Email Services. Template ID: Email Templates. Public key: Account.
# Set Account > Security > "Allowed domains" to your GitHub Pages domain, or
# anyone can spend your monthly quota.
#
# The contact template body uses: {{name}} {{email}} {{message}}
# Set the template's Reply-To field to {{reply_to}} — NOT {{email}}. The form
# accepts a phone number too, and EmailJS rejects the send when Reply-To is not
# a valid address. {{reply_to}} is the address when they gave one, mine when
# they gave a phone number instead.
REACT_APP_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
REACT_APP_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
REACT_APP_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=

# Optional second template, for doodles. It gets {{name}} {{note}} {{prompt}}
# {{image_url}} and {{message}}, so it can show the drawing inline with
# <img src="{{image_url}}" width="400">. Leave blank and doodles fall back to
# the contact template above, which still receives the link inside {{message}}.
REACT_APP_EMAILJS_DOODLE_TEMPLATE_ID=

# --- Cloudinary (https://console.cloudinary.com) -----------------------------
# Where the doodle PNG goes before its link is emailed. Cloud name is on the
# dashboard. The preset is Settings > Upload > Upload presets > Add, with
# Signing mode set to UNSIGNED.
#
# The preset is the only thing constraining these uploads, since its name is
# visible in the bundle. On that preset, set:
#   - Signing mode: Unsigned
#   - Folder: doodles
#   - Max file size: 5000000  (5MB)
#   - Allowed formats: png,jpg
REACT_APP_CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
REACT_APP_CLOUDINARY_UPLOAD_PRESET=
